The integration in custom_components/kodi and its tests in tests/components/kodi
started as a copy of the Kodi integration of Home Assistant Core, dev branch at
commit 2fdf7b57d3e1a4261239c5c0ce33b51893b6c4c1, with the changes of
home-assistant/core#192353 and of the connection handling prepared for Home
Assistant Core applied. The git history of this repository records every change
since, and README.md lists where the code differs from the code in core.

The settings in pyproject.toml and tests/ruff.toml are taken from Home Assistant
Core. The brand images in custom_components/kodi/brand come from the Home
Assistant brands repository (https://github.com/home-assistant/brands).
